{"id":"33f5714c4668caa5","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-delta-formula.md","title":"Delta Formula Relative to a Theory","display":"df-delta-formula — Delta Formula Relative to a Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-delta-formula","aliases":["62-df-delta-formula"],"display":"df-delta-formula — Delta Formula Relative to a Theory","depends_on":["[[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]","[[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]","[[62-df-derivability]]","[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §I.7; §§VIII.3–VIII.4 (double definability)","source_pages":[25,310,322],"source_pdf_pages":[43,328,340]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-delta-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-delta-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-delta-formula — Delta Formula Relative to a Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eaea482f0ad24c81\" href=\"?note=eaea482f0ad24c81\" title=\"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy\">62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8535a715d3193fba\" href=\"?note=8535a715d3193fba\" title=\"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy\">62-df-AnalyticHierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §I.7; §§VIII.3–VIII.4 (double definability)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>25</span><span>310</span><span>322</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43</span><span>328</span><span>340</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}\\)</span>；两种公式层级见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eaea482f0ad24c81\" href=\"?note=eaea482f0ad24c81\" title=\"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy\">62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8535a715d3193fba\" href=\"?note=8535a715d3193fba\" title=\"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy\">62-df-AnalyticHierarchy</a>；全称闭包和可推导关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)\">\\(\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)\\)</span> 是上游的算术公式类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}delta\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\\;E_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2),\\qquad E_1\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}^{2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}delta\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\\;E_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2),\\qquad E_1\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}^{2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^i_n(T;S_2)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in E_i:\\exists\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^i_n(S_2)\\exists\\pi\\in\\Pi^i_n(S_2)\\ [T\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\sigma)\\land T\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\pi)]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta^i_n(T;S_2)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in E_i:\\exists\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^i_n(S_2)\\exists\\pi\\in\\Pi^i_n(S_2)\\ [T\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\sigma)\\land T\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\pi)]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是本目录明确带基理论参数的辅助约定；并非书中 Δ⁰₁ 理解公理的替代定义。双重“可定义”比较相同自由参数的公式代表，必要时用未使用参数对齐；允许代表含额外自由参数时，UC 要求等价对这些参数一致成立。字面句法交集不能表达基理论中的两种等价描述。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），§I.7; §§VIII.3–VIII.4 (double definability)；纸面页 25, 310, 322；PDF 页 43, 328, 340。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"eaea482f0ad24c81","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"8535a715d3193fba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"98c3cbeb95500b53","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"eaea482f0ad24c81","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}$；两种公式层级见 [[62-df-